{
  "name": "Granular Capture",
  "description": "Stereo stutter/freeze and granular playback. MIDI channel 16: CC20 Stutter, CC21 Freeze, CC22 Capture, CC23 Granular. Switches use 0=off and 127=on. Capture needs a 0 between triggers. All switches off passes dry. Reset all four CCs to 0 on sequencer stop. Freeze holds audio indefinitely until released; rack restart clears the buffer. Restart the rack after changing performance controllers.",
